      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc edit ScaledObject scaledobject"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Add the <code>autoscaling.keda.sh/paused-replicas</code> annotation with any value:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: keda.sh/v1alpha1\nkind: ScaledObject\nmetadata:\n  annotations:\n    autoscaling.keda.sh/paused-replicas: \"4\" (1)\n  creationTimestamp: \"2023-02-08T14:41:01Z\"\n  generation: 1\n  name: scaledobject\n  namespace: my-project\n  resourceVersion: '65729'\n  uid: f5aec682-acdf-4232-a783-58b5b82f5dd0"} lang="yaml" />
      <ol><li>Specifies that the Custom Metrics Autoscaler Operator is to scale the replicas to the specified value and stop autoscaling.</li></ol>
      </li>
      </ol>
      <h2 id="nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-pausing-restart_nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-pausing" class="group scroll-mt-20">Restarting the custom metrics autoscaler for a scaled object<a href="#nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-pausing-restart_nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-pausing" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
